{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30159","headline":"题筹笔驿 · 殷潜之","name":"题筹笔驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江东矜割据，邺下夺孤嫠。\n霸畧非匡汉，宏图欲佐谁。\n奏书辞後主，仗劒出全师。\n重袭襃斜路，悬开反正旗。\n欲将苞有截，必使举无遗。\n沈虑经谋际，挥毫决胜时。\n圜觚当分画，前箸此操持。\n山秀扶英气，川流入妙思。\n算成功在彀，运去事终亏。\n命屈天方厌，人亡国自随。\n艰难推旧姓，开创极初基。\n总叹曾过地，宁探作教资。\n若归新历数，谁复顾衰危。\n报德兼明道，长留识者知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷潜之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30159.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30159","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}